File: parser.c
Line: 10784
Function: xmlParseLookupInternalSubset
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: While scanning for the start of a comment, the code checks (cur[1] == '!') && (cur[2] == '-') && (cur[3] == '-') with only (cur < end) as a loop guard. If cur is at or near the end of the buffer, accessing cur[1..3] can read beyond the buffer end.

